WEBVTT

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:05.330
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.900
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.970
Hey, guys, why do people give 
chocolates on Valentine's Day?

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:14.030
That is a sorrowful tale indeed.

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:17.000
Once upon a time, in a certain kingdom, weddings were forbidden.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.090
But! A priest named Valentine heard the cries of love unfulfilled, 

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:21.170
I'm sure it's because of the sweet 
and pleasant feelings they bring.

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:23.160
and would secretly marry two lovers, unbeknownst to the King.

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:22.890
It sure is an exciting day,

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:24.970
so have as much fun as you possibly can! 

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:26.080
If the King had found out about it, 
he would've been in big trouble!

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:25.790
Doki!

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:30.180
Yes! Yes!

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:33.100
Let's go!

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:36.110
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.900
Shugo, shugo! Yes!

00:00:44.990 --> 00:00:47.600
Swing your arms! Hop, step, jump!

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:52.140
Now start marching straight ahead!

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:55.750
Way too awesome! Yes!

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:59.270
Every dream I've ever had!

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:04.980
Since they're all actually coming true.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:11.100
What kind of person will I be today?

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:16.390
What counts is being true to yourself!

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:20.540
Going somewhere?

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:22.960
Take it to the finish!

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:26.450
You'll always be able to

00:01:26.450 --> 00:01:29.390
unlock your heart.

00:01:29.390 --> 00:01:32.350
So keep on changing!

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:34.760
It's so exciting!

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:42.890
Let's go forward, believing in our hearts!

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:45.620
Straight ahead!

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:47.280
Yeah! Yeah!

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:06.250
Look at how excited everyone is!

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:08.640
Valentine's Day will finally 
be here tomorrow, after all. 

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:12.670
Will you be giving Tadase-kun 
chocolates, Amu-chan?

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:16.080
Like I care about Valentine's Day...

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.520
Hey, Yukina-chan!

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:22.430
Can you tell me how to do 
this "hot water bath" part?

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:26.770
You float the bowl with the chocolate in it 
in another one filled with hot water.

00:02:26.770 --> 00:02:29.180
The heat from the hot water 
will melt the chocolate!

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:33.800
It sounds like that girl is going 
to make her own chocolates. 

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:35.600
All by herself?

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:38.160
Man, Valentine's Day is so stupid.

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:39.560
Don't you think, Daisuke?

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:42.680
Y-Yeah...

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:46.300
But you're a special case, since you 
hate chocolate in the first place.

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:49.930
I can't help it. You hate what you hate.

00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:52.790
Hey, Yukina-chan?

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:55.930
Will you be giving anyone chocolates?

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:59.300
Oh, no... I don't really care about things like that.

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:04.770
Episode 70
I Hate These Stupid Chocolates!?

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:10.570
Next, I think we should review the schedule 
for tomorrow's Valentine's Day events.

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:13.920
We have the Confession Competition, 
the Love Song Contest,

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:17.720
and the main event, the Chocolate 
Candy Contest finals.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:23.640
Sheesh, only at this school would 
Valentine's Day turn into such a circus.

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:29.060
It makes being a Guardian even harder, with all the extra work. 

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:31.680
Some of us have chocolates 
to make, you know.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:34.540
I agree that it's a tough time for girls,

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:38.150
but it's still enjoyable to make chocolates 
and give them out, don't you think?  

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:40.560
I suppose I'm viewing it from 
the other side this year...

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:42.730
Huh? You're going to make chocolates?

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:44.920
What do you mean by the other side?

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:46.670
U-Uh, that's, well...

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:50.180
He means that it's his first Valentine's 
Day at Seiyo Academy. 

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:52.410
U-Uh... right, yeah!

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:56.790
So? What will you do? 

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:58.310
I already said...  

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:03.580
If you're too embarrassed to make chocolates just for him, why don't you make them for everybody?

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:06.100
Oh, good idea! I could do that.

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:08.620
But you know...

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:11.310
I'm home!

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:15.930
Perfect timing! Won't you come 
with us, Amu-chan?

00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:17.710
Wet's go, wet's go!

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:19.100
Go where?

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:22.280
Homemade chocolates class!

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:24.340
Let's go!

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:35.950
Homemade, huh?

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:40.470
You made these yourself, Hinamori-san? 
Wow! They look professional!

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:42.340
If only!

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:43.300
Huh?

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:45.520
Hinamori-san?

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:47.570
Oh, you're from the Moon Class.

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:49.240
I'm Kogure Yukina.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:53.600
Oh! Will you be competing in the contest tomorrow as well, Hinamori-san?

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:55.520
No way!

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.020
Wait, does that mean...

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:59.060
Yup, I'm gonna participate.

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:01.630
I'm after the grand prize, of course.

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:04.270
That's why I came here today, to practice!

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:06.100
Oh, I see! That's cool.

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:09.320
I'm aiming to become a pastry chef!

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:11.220
Sweets are so great, don't you think?

00:05:11.220 --> 00:05:13.220
They epitomize every young girl's dreams!

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:17.970
Welcome, everyone. 

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:22.720
I hope we can all enjoy learning how to 
make delicious chocolates today.

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:25.970
It's Lulu-chan's father!

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:29.980
Today, we'll be making chocolate truffles.

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:32.220
We'll begin with the ganache. {I'm familiar with ganache, and it's exactly what is used to fill truffles, so I think it should stay ^_^ Especially since he's teaching a class, you'd think he'd teach them proper terminology.}

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:35.980
The ingredients are chocolate and cream. {Truffles are made with heavy cream, not whipped cream}

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:38.990
First, you chop the chocolate into itty-bitty pieces,

00:05:38.990 --> 00:05:42.030
and then you heat up the cream.

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:45.150
Next, you melt your chopped-up chocolate, 

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:47.290
and give it a good mix. 

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:49.770
And voila, the ganache is finished!

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:53.060
At this point, you can make it into all kinds of shapes.

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:58.180
Shoot...

00:05:58.180 --> 00:06:00.300
Wanna Character Change with Su?

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:12.430
No, I'm going to make them myself.

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:18.100
Who will you be giving your chocolates to?

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:21.260
A boy you like, am I right?

00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:23.230
I'm just making them for the other Guardians! {Not literal, so you might not like it, but it puts it more on a friend/co-"worker" level than mushy-gushy love, I think}

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:31.970
This here's the place where I sense a poor, lost soul!

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:34.020
Isn't this...

00:06:34.390 --> 00:06:38.020
We'll finish them off by making the chocolate shell. 

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:40.890
This procedure is called tempering.

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:45.930
Papa! Why would you hold a candy workshop with these commoners in such a low-class place?

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:49.180
Hinamori Amu!

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:53.530
Tempering is a special way to melt chocolate. 

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:58.760
You melt it, then cool it, then heat it up once more. 

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:01.850
It's very important to regulate the temperature.

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:04.520
You then take the cooled balls of ganache

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:09.350
and coat them with the tempered chocolate.

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:12.720
And then, all that's left are the finishing touches!

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:14.640
All done!

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:18.490
Ace, Queen, Jack, and King!

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:21.450
Yours really turned out well!

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:22.620
You think?

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:24.310
I's done, too!

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:27.950
Finished.

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:30.510
Oh, they look pretty!

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:32.100
And delicious!

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:33.370
Really?

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:36.720
What have we here? Excellent job, young lady. 

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:38.630
May I taste one?

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:40.470
Go ahead.

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:47.240
Yes, it's good. 

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:48.940
Thank you very much!

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:53.650
However, mind the mixing a bit more next time, and you'll create a smoother texture.

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:54.420
Right!

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:59.270
The most important things to consider are the feelings of the person who will eat them.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:00.810
Right...

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:04.220
You hate what you hate.

00:08:10.270 --> 00:08:12.440
There's our target, you betcha!

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:19.890
Are you going to give those chocolates 
to anyone, Hinamori-san?

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:22.380
Yeah, just to some friends.

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:23.720
What about you?

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:30.270
If I win the grand prize, there's someone I'd like to give those chocolates to.

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:32.540
Is it a boy you like?

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:36.310
No! Just this guy who's been in the same class as me since first grade!

00:08:36.310 --> 00:08:39.930
I'd give anything to have him say "these are delicious," just once. 

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:43.850
I tried giving him chocolates last year, but...

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:45.470
Here!

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:46.360
Huh?

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:49.890
It's just out of courtesy. No one else 
gave you any, right?

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:53.640
I don't need them! 
I hate chocolate, anyway!

00:08:56.680 --> 00:09:01.140
My dream is to create sweets that would make anyone smile!

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:04.970
And that's why I'm determined to 
make chocolates so scrumptious 

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:07.740
even that chocolate-hating jerk will eat them!

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:13.200
She certainly is passionate about this. 

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:17.950
Yukina-chan actually likes 
that boy, doesn't she?

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:20.880
Dese are for you, Daddy!

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:24.000
We know it's a day early, but we poured our hearts into them... 

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:24.830
Into them!

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:27.410
Thank you! I'm overwhelmed!

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:29.140
Darling, Ami-chan, thank you!

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:30.350
Here.

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:32.970
Aww, from you, too?

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:35.520
She's just worried, so this is a taste test.

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:39.760
How are they?

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:41.430
Delicious!

00:09:41.670 --> 00:09:43.810
All right!

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:45.580
Yum, so are these. 

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:51.760
Those aren't for you, Dad!

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:55.020
All that's left are the King's.

00:09:55.310 --> 00:09:59.110
I guess this means you'll only be giving them 
to your special someone, after all.

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:12.050
Here, Tadase-kun!

00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:13.150
Thank you.

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:17.140
Hotori-senpai, please have these!

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:18.440
Thank you.

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:21.610
He sure is popular.

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:24.300
Amu-chan, get in line, quickly!

00:10:28.680 --> 00:10:31.080
No, I think I'll wait until later. 

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:32.090
Good idea.

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:35.060
Great work, everyone!

00:10:35.060 --> 00:10:39.100
Thanks for your help! Please keep working hard for Hoshina Utau!

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:41.180
Ah, here, please take one, and another...  

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:44.220
Tough day, huh?

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:49.360
What's tough? Valentine's Day is a great chance to raise your profile.

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:53.590
Even at a small event like this, we've got to maintain our social network. 

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:56.020
It's the first step toward our future!

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:57.160
True...

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:02.780
But working on such a lovely Valentine's Day is just...

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:04.220
We have no choice. 

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:06.060
Dummy!

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:08.940
Utau wanted to give chocolates, too, you know!

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:11.560
But she wasn't able to contact him.

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:13.480
Ah! So that's it...

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:16.790
Utau-chan...

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:21.070
Ikuto, where are you?

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:35.650
Ikuto.

00:11:39.020 --> 00:11:41.810
You guys! Thank you-nya!

00:11:43.490 --> 00:11:47.320
Ikuto, put this on, it'll warm you up-nya.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:52.100
Sorry about this, Yoru.

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:14.380
Lighting, check! Decorations, check!

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:15.850
Perfect!

00:12:15.850 --> 00:12:19.310
6th Grade Moon Class

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:17.590
Do your best, okay?

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:19.310
We'll be cheering for you!

00:12:19.310 --> 00:12:21.690
Sure! Thanks, everyone.

00:12:21.690 --> 00:12:24.730
Let me have a taste of those chocolates if you win.

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:26.430
Uh, but...

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:28.530
Man, don't hog them all. 

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:30.090
Right, Daisuke?

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:36.550
Even if you win, I wouldn't want to eat any chocolates...

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:38.970
Yukina-chan?

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:42.040
I've got to go. Bye!

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:44.220
Good luck!

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:58.430
You're lost, aren't you?

00:12:58.430 --> 00:13:02.310
Even if you give your best effort and finally make chocolates for him,

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:04.140
it's all for naught if he won't eat them.

00:13:05.540 --> 00:13:09.620
This jewelry will grant that wish of yours.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:18.640
He accepts!

00:13:18.640 --> 00:13:20.970
He said, "okay!" 

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:28.320
Everyone seems to be enjoying themselves. 

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:32.790
Let me explain how the Chocolate 
Candy Contest will proceed.

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:33.750
Huh?

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:35.670
What's the matter, Amu?

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:37.770
Yukina-chan isn't here.

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:40.500
Amu-chan, I can sense a ? Egg!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:41.960
Right now?

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:45.250
We can't have all the Guardians leaving...

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:46.730
I'll go.

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:48.760
The rest of you handle the contest, please. 

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:54.520
Good luck, Amu-chan!

00:14:00.180 --> 00:14:01.850
Amu-chan, this way!

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:11.350
Character Transformation: Chocolate Dream!

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:16.020
My chocolates will make everyone happy!

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:20.770
Get a move on, y'all!

00:14:24.030 --> 00:14:26.740
Guess we're not getting chocolates again this year...

00:14:26.740 --> 00:14:27.390
Yeah...

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:33.580
I'll give you the best chocolates you've ever had! {I think we can drop the "present" since I think "give" is related to gift/present." It's too wordy and awkward otherwise}

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:38.890
Chocolates!

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:42.570
Delicious chocolates make people happy.

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:58.030
They're eating chocolates.

00:14:58.030 --> 00:14:59.930
Is this Yukina-chan's doing?

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:01.250
Let's hurry!

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:01.960
Yeah.

00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:12.380
Have a happy Valentine's Day! I'll turn 
everything into chocolate for you!

00:15:12.770 --> 00:15:15.600
Understood. Yes, yes.

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:29.550
So? How do my chocolates taste? 

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:30.760
Yukina-chan!

00:15:31.100 --> 00:15:33.070
Come back to school with me. 

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:34.850
The contest is about to start!

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:37.720
I don't care about that anymore. 

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:40.730
But you worked so hard! 

00:15:43.890 --> 00:15:45.430
Take this!

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:58.880
Amu-chan!

00:15:58.880 --> 00:15:59.790
Right!

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:04.450
My heart:

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:06.460
Unlock!

00:16:24.770 --> 00:16:27.320
Character Transformation: Amulet Clover!

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:43.970
Allow me, if you please.

00:16:45.290 --> 00:16:46.680
It's no use!

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:53.230
You know your stuff, Yukina-chan! This was melted perfectly!

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:55.530
It's our turn now, Amu-chan!

00:16:55.530 --> 00:16:56.520
Okay!

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:03.940
Won't you have some delicious chocolates?

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:13.010
That's our Su!

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:14.560
What a delicate sweetness.

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:16.600
I just can't help myself!

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:19.640
This here's some good stuff!

00:17:20.090 --> 00:17:21.520
Nana!

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:24.520
I'm not through yet!

00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:26.120
Stop it!

00:17:27.260 --> 00:17:30.850
There's only one person you want 
to give chocolates to, right?

00:17:30.850 --> 00:17:34.220
Sure, it takes a lot of courage to give chocolates.

00:17:34.220 --> 00:17:36.810
But since you worked so hard to make them... 

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:38.630
Just do it!

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:42.170
You've got to tell him how you honestly feel!

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:43.700
It's almost like...

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:45.890
Amu-chan is talking about her own feelings.

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:48.190
My honest... 

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:49.890
Feelings?

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:57.180
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:02.890
Open Heart!

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:27.510
Yukina-chan.

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:28.720
Yukina-chan!

00:18:30.470 --> 00:18:32.620
The contest is going to start!

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:35.180
Oh no! I have to hurry!

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:14.980
And now, we'll announce the results.

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:18.600
The winner of this year's Chocolate Candy Contest is:

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:22.590
Kogure Yukina-san, from the 6th Grade Moon Class.

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:28.520
You did it, Yukina-chan!

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:46.300
I actually won.

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:47.890
Now, all I have to do is...

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:49.360
Hey.

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:52.420
So you won, huh?

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:53.520
Congrats.

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:55.400
W-What's with you?

00:19:55.400 --> 00:19:58.560
Do you think I'm going to give these to you?

00:19:58.560 --> 00:20:01.290
And here I thought you hated chocolates. 

00:20:01.890 --> 00:20:04.760
Oh, why must I always be like this?

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:06.020
I lied.

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:12.060
Back then, I lied to you because I was embarrassed. 

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:13.450
So...

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:16.910
Oh, that's so dumb!

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:21.070
D-Don't laugh.

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:26.020
Amu-chan, look.

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:31.040
Wow, these are great!

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:32.020
Really?

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:33.140
Yeah!

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:34.890
I'm so glad! 

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:39.730
It's your turn next, Amu-chan.

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:41.700
Hinamori-san!

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:43.990
T-Tadase-kun!

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:45.870
You sure had a tough time today.

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:47.270
Nice job.

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:49.000
Thanks...

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:51.350
Amu-chan, now's your chance!

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:56.390
Huh?

00:20:57.350 --> 00:20:58.400
They're gone! 

00:20:58.400 --> 00:20:59.690
What's the matter?

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:03.560
Well, I actually made some chocolates, you see... 

00:21:03.560 --> 00:21:06.250
And I was thinking of giving them to you, Tadase-kun.

00:21:07.560 --> 00:21:13.350
But it looks like I dropped them somewhere 
when I was chasing after Yukina-chan.

00:21:13.350 --> 00:21:15.430
Oh, I see. That's too bad.

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:19.460
I was looking forward to your 
chocolates, Hinamori-san.

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:22.010
R-Really?

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:22.920
Yeah.

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:25.160
Well then, next time...

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:39.140
I'm starving-nya...

00:21:39.140 --> 00:21:41.360
God, you're there, aren't you-nya?

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:43.760
Please, I'll take anything-nya!

00:21:47.470 --> 00:21:49.330
What's this?

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:52.150
Ikuto!

00:21:53.190 --> 00:21:56.610
Ikuto, eat these-nya! I'm sure you'll feel better!

00:21:58.170 --> 00:21:59.220
Chocolates?

00:21:59.220 --> 00:22:01.290
Where did you get them?

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:03.200
They fell from heaven-nya!

00:22:03.200 --> 00:22:05.820
I'm sure they're a gift from God-nya!

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:13.390
They're pretty good.

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:16.780
Break me off a piece, will ya-nya?

00:22:22.480 --> 00:22:26.350
We'll walk this path,

00:22:26.350 --> 00:22:30.140
no matter what may happen.

00:22:30.470 --> 00:22:34.430
Because when we combine our strength,

00:22:34.430 --> 00:22:38.350
something's bound to change!

00:22:46.220 --> 00:22:53.660
You're always so quick to say "absolutely,"

00:22:54.170 --> 00:22:58.030
but shouldn't you think it through a bit first?

00:22:58.400 --> 00:23:01.410
Can't you at least do that???

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:06.160
You know, I'm starting to understand

00:23:06.160 --> 00:23:09.620
the delicate movements of the heart.

00:23:10.060 --> 00:23:17.080
My own abilities aren't really all that special...

00:23:18.390 --> 00:23:22.380
But even if the first shot's off the mark

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:26.250
the third'll bravely hit the bull's-eye!

00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:32.340
We'll walk this path,

00:23:32.340 --> 00:23:35.960
even if it's a steep climb.

00:23:36.420 --> 00:23:40.430
Because when we put our hearts together

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:44.380
something definitely changes!

00:23:50.020 --> 00:23:53.930
I wonder what happened to the 
chocolates you made, Amu-chan.

00:23:53.930 --> 00:23:55.960
It doesn't matter, I'll make 
them again another time. 

00:23:55.960 --> 00:23:59.050
Hey, hey, Amu-chan! We're going 
on a trip next time, right?

00:23:59.050 --> 00:24:00.890
And with Tadase-kun, at that!

00:24:01.230 --> 00:24:04.630
It won't be just the two of us. A bunch of 
other kids from school will be there. 

00:24:04.630 --> 00:24:08.470
That's right! We'll even see a certain someone we haven't seen in a while!

00:24:08.470 --> 00:24:09.990
A certain someone?

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:12.020
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.020 --> 00:24:14.680
The Arduous Path of Truth! Kairi Returns! 

00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:17.410
The young girl's heart wavers in uncertainty...

00:24:17.410 --> 00:24:19.450
It's not like that!
